Premium → Free

and confirm the subscription badge changes too.

One improvement I'd like to make next
Once updates are confirmed, I'd like to add a success message:

✅ User updated successfully.

instead of silently redirecting.

It gives administrators immediate feedback that their action was successful.

One security improvement
Before we add delete functionality, I'd also like to prevent administrators from accidentally changing their own role or demoting themselves. For example:

An admin shouldn't be able to remove their own admin role accidentally.

Depending on your business rules, only a superuser might be allowed to promote someone else to superuser.

Those kinds of safeguards are common in production systems and help prevent accidental lockouts.

Let's first confirm the update flow works correctly, then we'll add those guardrails and polish the experience. 🚀


