    ...
});
and decides

404 ?

↓

Render 404.ejs
or

403 ?

↓

Render 403.ejs
or

500 ?

↓

Render 500.ejs
This is called...
Centralized Error Handling.

It's the pattern used in Express applications because it keeps controllers focused on business logic.

